<h1>Blunt Abdominal Injury</h1>
<p class='ddc-reviewed-by'><span><a class='ddc-reviewed-by-link' href='/support/editorial-policy.html#editorial-staff'>Medically reviewed</a> by Drugs.com. Last updated on Nov 4, 2026.</span></p>

